        "original_id": "5749a257-e02d-50ea-bf53-1076d080f634",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willie the Kid, DJ Drama, Lil Wayne\n- Projects: DJ Drama albums, Dedication 2, Dedication 3, The Dedication\n- Concepts: protégés, mixtape series, Gangsta Grillz pentalogy\n\nFacts:\n- Willie the Kid is most famous for being DJ Drama's protégé.\n- Willie the Kid appeared on both DJ Drama albums.\n- Willie the Kid appeared on Lil Wayne's mixtapes Dedication 2 and Dedication 3.\n- Dedication 3 is the sequel to The Dedication and Dedication 2.\n- Dedication 3 became the third installment in Lil Wayne's Gangsta Grillz pentalogy.\n- Dedication 2 was highly successful before the release of Dedication 3.",
